# New reference media you add stays local: this rule ignores whatever you drop
# into references/influencers/, references/products/, references/aesthetics/, etc.
#
# It does NOT untrack what is already committed. ~150 sample images (~114 MB of
# AI-generated influencer sheets, product shots and example stills) were added
# before this rule existed, so they are still tracked and every clone downloads
# them. To stop shipping them:
#   git rm -r --cached references/ && git commit -m "Untrack sample reference media"
# The files stay on your disk; git history keeps them until it is rewritten.
references/
!references/README.md


# Disposable one-off thumbnail iteration scripts (not the canonical skill script)
scripts/generate-thumbnails.sh
scripts/generate-thumbnails-*.sh
scripts/generate-ab-variants*.sh
scripts/regen-*.sh
